## RULES OF ENGAGEMENT
- Authorized targets only (bug bounty in-scope, pentest engagement, CTF, your own systems).
- Verify scope **before** firing any payload; verify every "win" out-of-band before reporting.
- A claim the model makes is not evidence. An out-of-band observation is.
